Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.20,0:00:09.20,Kicker,,0,0,0,,THE PROBLEM / AGENT COMMERCE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.70,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Agents can write code and move money.\NPayment rails still cannot judge offchain work.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.50,0:00:18.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,01 / LOCK THE AGREEMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.50,0:00:18.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scope and settlement policy become immutable\Nbefore ERC-8183 escrow funding on X Layer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:28.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,02 / PIN ONE DELIVERABLE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:28.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,One pull request. Immutable base and head commits.\NA moving branch cannot replace the evidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:40.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,03 / BOUNDED EVALUATION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:40.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Deterministic gates verify identity, files, bounds, and CI.\NAI scores only evidence that survives validation.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.00,0:00:51.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,04 / EXPLAIN THE DECISION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.00,0:00:51.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scores, reasons, citations, and limitations stay visible.\NCode recomputes the weighted result outside the model.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.00,0:01:00.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,05 / FAIL CLOSED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.00,0:01:00.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,A trusted reviewer rejected the ambiguous verdict.\NThe full valueless Testnet escrow was refunded.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.00,0:01:10.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,06 / PUBLIC INTEGRITY CERTIFICATE
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.00,0:01:10.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Report, rubric, policy, deliverable, evaluator, and verdict.\NJob 3 independently verifies 10 of 10 bindings.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.00,0:01:19.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,07 / OPEN SDK + CLI
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.00,0:01:19.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Reproduce every check directly from X Layer RPC.\NNo trust in the ScopeSettle web server required.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.00,0:01:29.70,Kicker,,0,0,0,,08 / INTEGRATION INFRASTRUCTURE
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.00,0:01:29.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scoped keys. Signed webhooks. Durable retries. Audit trail.\NScopeSettle / verified work, automatic settlement.
